Spring Boot Annotations:-
SpringBoot provides so many annotations.
->That simplify Java Enterprise application development.
->Here are few examples:-
1.@SpringBootApplication -> it combines @Configuration,
@EnableAutoConfiguration,@ComponentScan
->This annotation is Entry Point for Spring Boot

2.@ComponentScan:-Scan the package for @Component,@Service to
auto register the beans
3.@Configuration:-Marks the class as a source of bean definitions
4.@Bean :-Declares a bean manually in a @Configuration class
5.@Autowired:-Automatically injects dependent beans
6.@Service:-Specialization of @Component for service layer class
7.@Repository:-DAO layer classes
8.@Controller :-Used for Spring MVC controllers
9.@RestController :-Combination of @Controller and @ResponseBody for
RESTful services.
