WEB SERVICES:-Web Services are a way for two different applications to communicate 
over the web using standard protocols.
Char:-
1.Platform Independent(Windows,Linux)
2.Language Independent(Java client can talk to Python Server)
3.Uses Standard protocols like HTTP,XML,JSON

Types of Web Services:-
1.SOAP:-Simple Object Access Protocol
->USES XML to encode messages
->Follow strict standards
->Protocol Based
->Slower and more complex
->Used in enterprise appln(Banking,telecom)

2.REST:-Representational State Transfer
->Uses HTTP methods(GEt,POST,PUT,DELETE)
->SEND/RECEIVE JSON OR XML(bUT USUALLY JSON)
->LIGHTWEIGHT AND FASTER THEN SOAP
->IT IS COMMONLY USED IN WEB AND MOBILE APPLN
->A REST API IS A WEB SERVICE THAT FOLLOWS REST ARCHITECTURE PRINCIPLES.
->IT ALLOWS SYSTEM TO COMMUNICATE OVER HTTP BY EXPOSING RESOURCES(DATA) VIA STANDARD METHOD.
